WEBVTT

00:08:59.683 --> 00:09:02.015
So they risked an experiment.

00:09:02.039 --> 00:09:06.284
They took the whole team away,
even in match season,

00:09:06.308 --> 00:09:07.723
on ski trips

00:09:07.747 --> 00:09:11.041
and to look at social projects in Chicago.

00:09:11.065 --> 00:09:12.591
This was expensive,

00:09:12.615 --> 00:09:14.567
it was time-consuming,

00:09:14.591 --> 00:09:16.272
and it could be a little risky

00:09:16.296 --> 00:09:20.070
putting a whole bunch of rugby players
on a ski slope, right?

00:09:20.094 --> 00:09:21.141
(Laughter)

00:09:21.165 --> 00:09:24.509
But what they found was that
the players came back

00:09:24.533 --> 00:09:29.799
with renewed bonds
of loyalty and solidarity.

00:09:29.823 --> 00:09:33.232
And now when they're on the pitch
under incredible pressure,